   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Medical and educational aid for civilians in UA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bevar Ukraine is providing humanitarian aid to Ukraine since 2014 and have therefore a well established process as well as good knowledge of the most urgent needs and efficient partners in Ukraine. Bevar Ukraine sent 173 trucks to Ukraine for the moment. Money spent for sending the trucks to Ukraine (1700 tons, 41 millions DKK) are used very efficiently as for every crown used for transportation provides around than 10 times higher value as content of trucks is donated by danish donors.</narrative>
  </description>
